On 27 December 2012 23:44, Pierre Abbat <phma@bezitopo.org> wrote:

> On Thursday, December 27, 2012 20:49:42 Jonathan Jones wrote:
> > On Thu, Dec 27, 2012 at 7:19 PM, Pierre Abbat <phma@bezitopo.org> wrote=
